      "readme_url": "https://github.com/firecracker-microvm/firecracker-containerd/blob/main/README.md",
      "readme_path": "README.md",
      "readme_sha": "7141c0169851b797daf05d23f7fdbdb868f587fb",
      "readme_excerpt": "We have made the decision to deprecate firecracker-containerd. firecracker-containerd was created to combine the lightweight, friendly interface of containers with the security of kernel-level isolation. When the project started, this was a novel approach. Since then, the ecosystem has matured: several projects now deliver the same model with more robust implementations and active investment behind them. Amazon has done the same via Nitro Sandboxes, which leverages Nitro Enclaves to achieve hardware-backed isolation for your container workloads. Given those alternatives, we have archived firecracker-containerd rather than continue partial maintenance. The repository will remain available in read-only form for reference. If you",
      "readme_headings": [
        "As of November 10 2026, this project is no longer maintained.",
        "TL;DR firecracker-containerd is no longer maintained. Please see [alternatives](#alternatives) for migrating workloads to more modern, secure alternatives.",
