      "readme_sha": "5053e4e1b102d331d94bfd6d580c6633f765903a",
      "readme_excerpt": "This demo showcases Firecracker's agility and high-density capabiliies. **It's been run on an EC2 i3.metal host (the defaults start 4000 microVMs) with an Ubuntu and an Amazon Linux 2 host OS, from an Ubuntu client.** Deviations from this setup will probably lead to issues and/or sub-par performance. If you want to help us support the demo on more platforms...we take pull requests :) Get this repo on an EC2 Intel metal instance. Open two terminals/ssh-connections to the instance. will show a heatmap of network traffic done by each microVM. python3 microvm-tiles.py will control the rest of the demo. Raise the",
